    "49190": {
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "The text states: 'We want waste designed out and fixing things \u2013 making them last \u2013 designed in.' This is an expression of a normative preference for sustainability and a critique of disposable culture. It reflects a moral stance towards environmental stewardship and responsible consumption, which is moral rhetoric."
