    "52325": {
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "The text proposes a Food Waste Bill to require retailers and manufacturers to take steps to reduce food waste. While it is a policy proposal, reducing food waste is often framed within a moral discourse of environmental stewardship and social responsibility. The act of requiring businesses to act on this issue implies a moral obligation to reduce waste."
