      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "The text mentions 'allies in spirit' who 'ended the Soviet terror that had consumed so many millions more.' The use of the word 'terror' to describe the Soviet system is a strong moral condemnation. It frames the conflict as a moral struggle between good (the allies) and evil (the Soviet terror). This is explicit moral rhetoric."
