    "57253": {
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "The text states: 'we will continue to support America’s groundbreaking biomedical researchers in their lifesaving work.' The term 'lifesaving work' emphasizes the moral value of the research. Supporting lifesaving work is a moral commitment to saving lives and promoting health."
