      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "The text affirms the rights of the people of the U.S. Virgin Islands and recognizes 'the valuable contributions made by the people...to the common welfare of the nation, including national defense.' This recognition of rights, contributions, and common welfare is an explicit invocation of moral principles such as justice, duty, and civic virtue."
