    "61223": {
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "The text states: 'Every person, however frail or vulnerable, has a place and a purpose in this world.' This is an explicit moral affirmation of human dignity and the value of every person. It is a clear and unambiguous statement of moral rhetoric."
